1999, high above Macross Island in the South Pacific,

02:47:49.150 --> 02:47:53.730
a phenomenal event occurred in the skies which altered the course of human history.

02:48:07.360 --> 02:48:11.780
a gigantic alien spaceship broke through the very fabric of hyperspace

02:48:11.780 --> 02:48:14.100
on a collision course with the Earth.

02:48:14.440 --> 02:48:20.880
Seeing its uncontrolled fall from the sky,

02:48:21.140 --> 02:48:24.640
the plummeting space fortress produced shockwaves of incredible force.

02:49:00.510 --> 02:49:12.530
The craft measured nearly three quarters of a mile in length.

02:49:12.860 --> 02:49:14.540
There was no sign of the alien crew.

02:49:14.950 --> 02:49:17.210
The armored hull had taken the brunt of the damage,

02:49:17.550 --> 02:49:20.250
leaving much of the sophisticated technosystems intact.

02:49:20.730 --> 02:49:24.450
What remained of the giant battle fortress gave evidence of a civilization

02:49:24.450 --> 02:49:27.590
that was light years ahead of Earth's most advanced thinking.

02:49:31.310 --> 02:49:38.570
Global war ravaged the Earth at that time, but even this devastation failed by comparison to the threat of invasion from outer space.

02:49:39.000 --> 02:49:43.860
A ceasefire was ordered, and world leaders banded together to form a united Earth government.

02:49:45.000 --> 02:49:51.220
Under the new government, the world's most brilliant minds formed a research team to study and restore the alien space fortress.

02:49:51.640 --> 02:49:59.520
Deciphering parts of documents found on board, they labored to unravel the secrets of an incredibly complex technology called Robotech.

02:50:00.160 --> 02:50:04.780
Convinced that the scientists had solved this complex riddle, world leaders ordered a celebration.

02:50:06.390 --> 02:50:19.320
Ten years, the total resources of an entire planet had been focused on the restoration of the space fortress.

02:50:21.510 --> 02:50:26.770
A great city had grown up around the Robotech project, and today, on the eve of the ship's maiden flight,

02:50:27.090 --> 02:50:29.970
every citizen, man, woman, and child was gathering...

02:50:30.000 --> 02:50:33.980
to celebrate their achievement, and to witness the launching of their planet's new defenders.

02:50:37.220 --> 02:50:39.860
